      "description": "The text 'in 2014, i helped put together and signed a $25 billion dollar deal to fund a border wall.' is attributed to Chuck Schumer, who is visually depicted in the image. The use of 'i' in the text creates an analogical mapping where the speaker (the 'i') is identified with the visual entity Chuck_Schumer. This mapping is reinforced by the context of the meme, which portrays Schumer as the political figure who supported the 2014 deal.",
